<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 26.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 26.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Thursday, June 26:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,693.80 (1,674.70)	CHF  1,176.60 (1,167.30)</p>
<p>    DEM    983.00 (971.07)	  GBP  2,821.50 (2,795.70)</p>
<p>    ATS    139.69 (138.02)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Wednesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $24.85 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$18.06 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $42.91 million ($31.71 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
